  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new EU guidelines for in-game purchases focus on better transparency, including showing the real-world cost of items, avoiding confusing premium currencies, and preventing bundle pricing that leaves leftover currency. Implementing these changes in VRChat would make purchases clearer, build trust within the community, and keep the platform ahead of potential regulations.\n\nClearer pricing and fairer transactions benefit everyone. Hoping to see VRChat take steps toward a more transparent system.\n\nThe guidelines are available here:\n\nhttps://commission.europa.eu/document/download/8af13e88-6540-436c-b137-9853e7fe866a_en?filename=Key%20principles%20on%20in-game%20virtual%20currencies.pdf",
